  "details": "<p>Based on an inscription from room W9,<em> </em>phase 1's terminus post quem is\u00a0<span>after 13 CE. The phase 1 version of the building was\u00a0<span>presumably damaged by an earthquake in 160 CE, since an inscription of 161 CE dedicating the temple to Artemis Azzanathkona was likely a renovation after earthquake damage.</span></span></p>",
